:: Home Combat Exaggerate Demonstration
<<effects>>

You show off some punches and kicks. You're mostly just winging it, but they don't seem to notice. At some point, a few of them start copying you, and before long, all of them are trying to imitate you. This goes on for a while, and you stop once your muscles start to ache.<<physique 1>>
<br><br>
They thank you once the demonstration ends, walking off and excitedly talking amongst themselves about you.<<stress -8>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Home Combat Exaggerate Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell them that you have something you need to do. They seem satisfied regardless and leave you alone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Home Combat Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell them that you're busy right now. Though obviously disappointed, they leave you alone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Home Orphan Rebellious Prank
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>> /* Follow them */
	You follow the orphans into Bailey's office. They speak in hushed whispers, and they both gasp when they see you.
	<br><br>
	<<if $baileydefeated gte 1 or $baileydefeatedlewd gte 1>>
		"Oh! It's you!" says the <<person1>><<person>>. "Aren't you the <<girl>> who <<= $baileydefeated gte 1 ? "kicked Bailey's ass" : "embarrassed Bailey">> in front of everyone? Do you want to join us? We're going to get one over on <<nnpc_him "Bailey">>, too!"
	<<else>>
		"Oh! You're not Bailey." The <<person1>><<person>> laughs<<if $orphan_hope gte 10>>. "Hey, do you want to join us?"<<else>> nervously, glancing at the bucket of murky water <<hes>> holding. "You're...not going to tell on us, are you?"<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"We're going to prank <<nnpc_him "Bailey">>," the <<person2>><<person>> explains. "It's the least <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> deserves after all <<nnpc_hes "Bailey">> done to us!" <<person2>><<He>> starts setting up the step ladder.
