	<<link [[Offer to help them set up|Home Orphan Rebellious Prank 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<reb 1>><</link>><<greb>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Offer to cover for them|Home Orphan Rebellious Prank 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<hope 1>><</link>><<ghope>>
