<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>> /* Tell them this is much too risky */
	<<if $englishSuccess>>
		<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
			You frown. "I... I'm sorry, but... I just really don't think this is a good idea. Wh-what if <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> finds out? I don't want anything bad to happen to any of you..." <span class="green">You recommend looking for hobbies that might enrich their lives, such as gardening or cooking.</span>
		<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
			"And what happens if <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> finds out about all this, huh?" You put your hands on your hips. "Even if <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> doesn't find out we're involved, what's stopping <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> from just punishing everybody instead? Don't be so naive." <span class="green">You recommend they start exercising instead so that they can blow off some steam and gain the strength to defend themselves.</span>
		<<else>>
			You shake your head. "Sorry to rain on your parade, but this is too risky. You two would be better off spending your time on yourselves, not on Bailey." <span class="green">You recommend extracurricular activities such as reading or dancing that might help reduce the orphans' stress.</span>
