<<effects>>

All three of you watch as Bailey enters <<his>> office. The bucket upends over <<him>> and <<he>> makes an undignified noise.
<br><br>
Soaking wet, <<he>> spins on <<his>> heels and barrels through the main hall in search of the culprits. <<He>> snarls at several orphans, who maintain innocence, before <<he>> comes across you and your partners in crime.
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 2>>
	Bailey eyes you suspiciously, given your intervention.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if ($orphan_hope + $orphan_reb) / 2 gte random(10,50)>>
